<title>FRANCE: Havas sees higher 1996 net attributable.</title>
<headline>Havas sees higher 1996 net attributable.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Publishing group Havas said on Thursday that it expected to report a rise in 1996 net attributable profit.</p>
<p>&quot;Despite uncertainties surrounding European economic trends, group markets should expand in 1996, with the exception of book publishing. As a result, net income, group share, should show a rise despite heavy investments in the audiovisual sector,&quot; it said in its first-half results statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
